					<div class='title' tabindex='0' 
						><i class='fa fa-plus'></i>
						How to get there					</div>
					<div class='altrama-accordion-content'>
						<p>Piazza del Popolo is located right in the heart of the city.</p>
<p><span style="color: #168084"><strong>On foot</strong>: </span>the area is easily reachable on foot from the nearby railway station.</p>
<p><span style="color: #168084"><strong>By bus</strong>: </span>the area surrounding Piazza del Popolo is served by public transport. For more information on bus routes: <a href="https://www.startromagna.it/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">startromagna.it</a></p>
<p><span style="color: #168084"><strong>By car</strong>:</span> access to the historical centre of Ravenna is limited. For more information on parking lots, click <a href="https://www.turismo.ra.it/en/getting-around-ravenna/parking-in-ravenna/">HERE</a>.</p>
					</div>
